#: ../userguides/pipelines.rst:196 cd3b89f202744919ae5d428386a38622
msgid ""
"Detect forest, trees and shrub vegetation from 0.6-0.3 m satellite "
"imagery. Covers sparse forest, shrubland, small tree groups and narrow "
"tree lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:5 e4dfb81c967b467b92a7ef9f01d0854f
msgid "🌲 Forest and trees"
msgstr "🌲 Bosques y árboles"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:7 29c77c8a918f4e1d8c77aff3e7845614
msgid ""
"The model is trained on high-resolution data (0.6-0.3m) for different "
"areas and climate zones."
msgstr ""
"El modelo se entrena con datos de alta resolución (0,6-0,3 m) para "
"diferentes áreas y zonas climáticas."

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:9 16b5a7f766344f0cb520fbb9fbeb359a
msgid ""
"The result includes all areas covered with tree and shrub vegetation, "
"including sparse forest and shrublands."
msgstr ""
"El resultado incluye todas las áreas cubiertas de vegetación arbórea y "
"arbustiva, incluidos bosques y matorrales dispersos."

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:11 ee1e178868414c8dab751febad32f873
msgid ""
"Model resolution allows to detect small group of trees and narrow tree "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"La resolución del modelo permite detectar pequeños grupos de árboles y "
"líneas estrechas de árboles."

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:13 24415f6baecf47e09ab005dcdd91d2f6
msgid ""
"The model is robust to region change, and performs well in most "
"environments, including urban. The image should be taken in active "
"vegetation period, because leafless trees or vegetation covered with snow"
" are not the target class."
msgstr ""
"El modelo es robusto al cambio regional y funciona bien en la mayoría de "
"los entornos, incluidos los urbanos. La imagen debe tomarse en un período"
" de vegetación activa, porque los árboles sin hojas o la vegetación "
"cubierta de nieve no son la clase objetivo."

