msgid ""
"Latest update — **🌲 Forest and trees v.2026-07-03** (Global, "
"Segmentation). The model was evaluated on a validation set of 6 areas of "
"interest (AOI) against manually annotated ground truth. Metrics are area-"
"based: IoU is the intersection-over-union of the predicted and ground-"
"truth vegetation masks, and F1 / Precision / Recall are computed on the "
"overlapping mask area."
